    "title": "Woman Admits to Stabbing Boyfriend in Lebanon County - NewsBreak",
    "text": "1 days ago In Lebanon County, Pennsylvania, Katlynn Kearney, 32, has admitted to fatally stabbing her boyfriend, 45-year-old Dontay Hunter, during a fight at their apartment. The incident occurred last weekend, and police discovered Hunter's body after responding to a well-being check at the 800 block of Chestnut Street on Sunday (October 5). Upon arrival, officers found Hunter deceased with significant blood on his right torso. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 5",
